{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/c9aa6c538bb9c1791fc890fe3378f7dd.poster.avif?t=1766397670\" width=780 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/c9aa6c538bb9c1791fc890fe3378f7dd.webm?t=1766397670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ROCKBEASTS is a rock &amp; roll management RPG set in an alternative 90s America. Written by the principal writer of The Witcher 3 and Cyberpunk 2077, featuring voices from Baldur's Gate 3 and rock legend Iggy Pop himself, this comedy-drama puts you behind the scenes of the music industry's brutal reality. Every choice shapes your band's journey from garage obscurity to stardom\u2014will you fight for creative freedom, or become industry sellouts?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/98b5c462f616cd3c1ce28a9b42905579.avif?t=1766397670\" width=1560 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/997ddda19bd6e55699130bdb53b5d5b0.poster.avif?t=1766397670\" width=780 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/997ddda19bd6e55699130bdb53b5d5b0.webm?t=1766397670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/997ddda19bd6e55699130bdb53b5d5b0.mp4?t=1766397670\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ROCKBEASTS tells an emotional, darkly funny story\u2014but every beat unfolds through hands-on gameplay. You don\u2019t watch your band struggle; you live it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete quests that define your journey, manage money, and fragile egos that determine success or simply survival. Craft setlists that make or break performances, repair equipment before shows, and take the stage yourself in rhythm-based concerts. There\u2019s no coasting\u2014this is an RPG where your actions drive the narrative forward, and every triumph and disaster happens because of what you did or failed to do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/12ba9d036b9f2e9ced2c1e4b192ed5ff.avif?t=1766397670\" width=1560 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/adc530dbf1dd74ff9d126bb36e3347b4.poster.avif?t=1766397670\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/adc530dbf1dd74ff9d126bb36e3347b4.webm?t=1766397670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/adc530dbf1dd74ff9d126bb36e3347b4.mp4?t=1766397670\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the music industry's moral minefield\u2014negotiate with predatory record labels, compromise (or don't) on creative vision, and balance authenticity against commercial pressure. From jaded venue owners to music promoters, and stone-cold label executives \u2014 your legend is written through the relationships you forge, the deals you accept, and the lines you refuse to cross.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/6324093d094676f4b0bae0234657e1bb.avif?t=1766397670\" width=1560 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/3a95a7635093b2b25a01263a78b8a670.poster.avif?t=1766397670\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/3a95a7635093b2b25a01263a78b8a670.webm?t=1766397670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/3a95a7635093b2b25a01263a78b8a670.mp4?t=1766397670\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your band\u2019s resources to keep it functional. Balance limited funds between feeding your musicians, repairing broken equipment, and booking rehearsal space. Keep them sane enough to survive and insane enough to keep it rocking!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/e13a03c2f3d9b77300cd97e264027f73.avif?t=1766397670\" width=1560 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/cc341c61de6ab118ab141622bb549783.poster.avif?t=1766397670\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/cc341c61de6ab118ab141622bb549783.webm?t=1766397670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/cc341c61de6ab118ab141622bb549783.mp4?t=1766397670\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prove your band's talent by constructing setlists showcasing their strengths, setting up gear that will emphasize their style and then giving on-stage dynamic rhythm-based performances. Success earns cash and brings the fans in. Failure costs you reputation and hits your band\u2019s morale. Master the stage, and doors open. Fail and watch opportunities evaporate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/cee5e694a0180f6446446e0ffdc4a938.avif?t=1766397670\" width=1560 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/7fb94fc620caf9f497ebd631a00bbb7f.poster.avif?t=1766397670\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/7fb94fc620caf9f497ebd631a00bbb7f.webm?t=1766397670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/7fb94fc620caf9f497ebd631a00bbb7f.mp4?t=1766397670\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a heartfully crafted alternative America where grunge, raging capitalism, and MTV collide. ROCKBEAST\u2019s hand-drawn art style captures the look &amp; feel of the best mature animated shows, bringing iconic locations to life\u2014from legendary venues and dive bars to record stores, radio stations, and the gritty streets where the scene was born.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seventeen original full-length tracks capture the sonic landscape of 90s alternative rock, letting you not only enjoy the famous Seattle Sound but also perform it yourself at in-game concerts. This isn't nostalgia\u2014it's a lived-in world that understands what made this era matter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/eec837cefd7106eaadd84f8e76995c87.avif?t=1766397670\" width=1560 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/04adf2c8ff7925d4d10f7e4bdfd9f151.poster.avif?t=1766397670\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/04adf2c8ff7925d4d10f7e4bdfd9f151.webm?t=1766397670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/04adf2c8ff7925d4d10f7e4bdfd9f151.mp4?t=1766397670\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day brings new challenges: egos clash, gear malfunctions and grinds of the industry slowly kill the creative spark. Will you turn garage noise into generation-defining anthems? Or will your band become just another cautionary tale of squandered potential? The music can change the world\u2014if they survive long enough to be heard. And it\u2019s only Monday.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1445880?t=1766397670","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/c9f9b5ea71db5cf7c2abfa216cd5fff9ab804da5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766397670","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/9c3c8170963ef55f4d94b56e725e0e75fa145dbc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766397670","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/9c3c8170963ef55f4d94b56e725e0e75fa145dbc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766397670","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Bad language\r\nTobacco and alcohol reference/use\r\nIllegal drug references\r\nSexual references"},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/c9aa6c538bb9c1791fc890fe3378f7dd.poster.avif?t=1766397670\" width=780 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/c9aa6c538bb9c1791fc890fe3378f7dd.webm?t=1766397670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ROCKBEASTS is a rock &amp; roll management RPG set in an alternative 90s America. Written by the principal writer of The Witcher 3 and Cyberpunk 2077, featuring voices from Baldur's Gate 3 and rock legend Iggy Pop himself, this comedy-drama puts you behind the scenes of the music industry's brutal reality. Every choice shapes your band's journey from garage obscurity to stardom\u2014will you fight for creative freedom, or become industry sellouts?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/98b5c462f616cd3c1ce28a9b42905579.avif?t=1766397670\" width=1560 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/997ddda19bd6e55699130bdb53b5d5b0.poster.avif?t=1766397670\" width=780 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/997ddda19bd6e55699130bdb53b5d5b0.webm?t=1766397670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/997ddda19bd6e55699130bdb53b5d5b0.mp4?t=1766397670\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ROCKBEASTS tells an emotional, darkly funny story\u2014but every beat unfolds through hands-on gameplay. You don\u2019t watch your band struggle; you live it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete quests that define your journey, manage money, and fragile egos that determine success or simply survival. Craft setlists that make or break performances, repair equipment before shows, and take the stage yourself in rhythm-based concerts. There\u2019s no coasting\u2014this is an RPG where your actions drive the narrative forward, and every triumph and disaster happens because of what you did or failed to do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/12ba9d036b9f2e9ced2c1e4b192ed5ff.avif?t=1766397670\" width=1560 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/adc530dbf1dd74ff9d126bb36e3347b4.poster.avif?t=1766397670\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/adc530dbf1dd74ff9d126bb36e3347b4.webm?t=1766397670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/adc530dbf1dd74ff9d126bb36e3347b4.mp4?t=1766397670\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the music industry's moral minefield\u2014negotiate with predatory record labels, compromise (or don't) on creative vision, and balance authenticity against commercial pressure. From jaded venue owners to music promoters, and stone-cold label executives \u2014 your legend is written through the relationships you forge, the deals you accept, and the lines you refuse to cross.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/6324093d094676f4b0bae0234657e1bb.avif?t=1766397670\" width=1560 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/3a95a7635093b2b25a01263a78b8a670.poster.avif?t=1766397670\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/3a95a7635093b2b25a01263a78b8a670.webm?t=1766397670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/3a95a7635093b2b25a01263a78b8a670.mp4?t=1766397670\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your band\u2019s resources to keep it functional. Balance limited funds between feeding your musicians, repairing broken equipment, and booking rehearsal space. Keep them sane enough to survive and insane enough to keep it rocking!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/e13a03c2f3d9b77300cd97e264027f73.avif?t=1766397670\" width=1560 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/cc341c61de6ab118ab141622bb549783.poster.avif?t=1766397670\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/cc341c61de6ab118ab141622bb549783.webm?t=1766397670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/cc341c61de6ab118ab141622bb549783.mp4?t=1766397670\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prove your band's talent by constructing setlists showcasing their strengths, setting up gear that will emphasize their style and then giving on-stage dynamic rhythm-based performances. Success earns cash and brings the fans in. Failure costs you reputation and hits your band\u2019s morale. Master the stage, and doors open. Fail and watch opportunities evaporate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/cee5e694a0180f6446446e0ffdc4a938.avif?t=1766397670\" width=1560 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/7fb94fc620caf9f497ebd631a00bbb7f.poster.avif?t=1766397670\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/7fb94fc620caf9f497ebd631a00bbb7f.webm?t=1766397670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/7fb94fc620caf9f497ebd631a00bbb7f.mp4?t=1766397670\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a heartfully crafted alternative America where grunge, raging capitalism, and MTV collide. ROCKBEAST\u2019s hand-drawn art style captures the look &amp; feel of the best mature animated shows, bringing iconic locations to life\u2014from legendary venues and dive bars to record stores, radio stations, and the gritty streets where the scene was born.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seventeen original full-length tracks capture the sonic landscape of 90s alternative rock, letting you not only enjoy the famous Seattle Sound but also perform it yourself at in-game concerts. This isn't nostalgia\u2014it's a lived-in world that understands what made this era matter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/eec837cefd7106eaadd84f8e76995c87.avif?t=1766397670\" width=1560 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/04adf2c8ff7925d4d10f7e4bdfd9f151.poster.avif?t=1766397670\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/04adf2c8ff7925d4d10f7e4bdfd9f151.webm?t=1766397670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/extras/04adf2c8ff7925d4d10f7e4bdfd9f151.mp4?t=1766397670\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day brings new challenges: egos clash, gear malfunctions and grinds of the industry slowly kill the creative spark. Will you turn garage noise into generation-defining anthems? Or will your band become just another cautionary tale of squandered potential? The music can change the world\u2014if they survive long enough to be heard. And it\u2019s only Monday.</p>","developers":["Lichthund"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1445880/a8bc64146ec88f438e26ff629bb95271ca4319a9/header.jpg?t=1766397670","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Rockbeasts \u00a9 Lichthund, published under licence by Team17 Digital Limited.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1445880/332045796/a562e571bfce309576ce78856925eca7c06716fe/1761040913/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761249145","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1445880/332045796/a562e571bfce309576ce78856925eca7c06716fe/1761040913/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761249145","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1445880/332045796/a562e571bfce309576ce78856925eca7c06716fe/1761040913/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761249145","id":257220437,"name":"ROCKBEASTS - Galaxies Trailer ","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257220437/ed625af6d19b60065b8aaced578e87e711f2d565/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1761249145"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1445880/216583818/997a59b54fba7978853f37f4cc1248c2a7091755/1753175895/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753182124","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1445880/216583818/997a59b54fba7978853f37f4